function TropicalEvolve(V, φ, T):
    ψ ← φ
    for t = 1 to T:
        for n = 0 to N-1:
            ψ_new[n] ← min(ψ[n], V[n] + ψ[n+1])
        ψ_new[N] ← ψ[N]
        ψ ← ψ_new
    return ψ

Time: O(T·N), Space: O(N)

function TropTransfer(W, φ):
    for i = 0 to n-1:
        ψ[i] ← min_j (W[i][j] + φ[j])
    return ψ

Time: O(n²), Space: O(n)
Equivalent to one Bellman-Ford relaxation step.
